( Wi-Fi Firmware - Installation Guide) Tj
T*
( Post-install wireless setup for Dell PCs running Debian-based Raspberry Pi Desktop.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( Overview) Tj
T*
( The install-wifi-firmware.sh script detects many PCI/PCIe and identifiable USB Wi-Fi adapters, selects an) Tj
T*
( appropriate Debian firmware package, installs it using APT, and checks for a wireless network interface.) Tj
T*
( It uses the computer's actual hardware IDs. It does not require Raspberry Pi hardware or create a Wi-Fi) Tj
T*
( connection for you.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( Requirements) Tj
T*
( An APT-based Debian system; Bash; sudo/root access for installation; and a temporary internet connection) Tj
T*
( through Ethernet or USB tethering. Firmware availability depends on the Debian release and configured) Tj
T*
( repositories.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    Before installing: Connect Ethernet or USB tethering. Without working internet access, the installer cannot download) Tj
T*
(    firmware packages.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( 1. Install firmware) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    sudo bash install-wifi-firmware.sh) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( The script prints detected Wi-Fi devices and suggested packages, refreshes APT package lists, installs available) Tj
T*
( firmware, and checks whether a wireless interface is present. Reboot after installation:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    sudo reboot) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( 2. Diagnose first \(no changes\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    bash install-wifi-firmware.sh --diagnose) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( Displays adapter IDs, any wireless interfaces already found, and suggested firmware packages. This mode does) Tj
T*
( not install packages or modify repositories.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( 3. Installer options) Tj
T*
(   Command                          Purpose) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   --diagnose                       Hardware scan only; no changes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   --no-repo                        Install using existing APT sources only; do not add a firmware repository.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   --help                           Display built-in usage instructions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Wi-Fi Firmware | Debian / Raspberry Pi Desktop on Dell PC                                                             1/2) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
